Upstream attribution
====================

Original author and upstream maintainer:

  wan0791
  https://github.com/wan0791

Original project:

  wan0791/harmonyos-wg-client
  https://github.com/wan0791/harmonyos-wg-client

Direct baseline this repository continues from:

  wumingkaiyuan/HarmonyOS-WireGuard-VPN-Client
  https://github.com/wumingkaiyuan/HarmonyOS-WireGuard-VPN-Client

  That repository contains the sanitized HarmonyOS API 23 adaptation work,
  including native TUN polling, RouteInfo construction and VpnExtension
  lifecycle handling, and is itself based on wan0791/harmonyos-wg-client.

The original HarmonyOS WireGuard client implementation and its historical
contributions remain the work of the upstream author and contributors.

Changes made on top of the baseline: the handshake and transport path was
moved out of ArkTS into a single-threaded C data plane (Noise IKpsk2, AEAD,
replay window, TUN/UDP poll loop), the UDP socket was switched from a
connected socket to sendto/recvfrom with post-authentication endpoint
roaming to survive NAT hairpin source rewriting, network-change recovery was
added to the VpnExtension, and the profile management and status UI was
rewritten. These are continued work built on the upstream project's results
and do not replace its attribution.

